<title>CANADA: BANK OF CANADA EXCESS SETTLEMENT BALANCES.</title>
<headline>BANK OF CANADA EXCESS SETTLEMENT BALANCES.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada's computed cumulative  excess settlement balance for the period July 17 to July 30 was C$-53  million, the Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
